`controls` is in scope inside animate (module-level const) ✓. `scene`, `camera`, `dbgEl`, `dbgRay`, `dbgFrame` are all in scope ✓.

One concern: does `renderer.render` happen even when the camera is outside? Yes, it does.

Note that the center raycast may hit the wall first — that's exactly what we want to know.

